# Magnitude ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** Personal AI Assistant.

Magnitude is an open-source coding agent with a local inference engine. It can profile hardware, recommend models and configure local execution.

## ODS integration

Magnitude is better treated as an application/agent integration than as the core ODS runtime. ODS can provide the appropriate local inference endpoint while Magnitude manages agent workflows and coding tasks.

## LEONES validation

Record separately:

- hardware observations;
- model/runtime recommendations;
- installation results;
- agent/tool behaviour;
- benchmark measurements.

Do not treat model recommendations as measured performance.

**Classification:** reference integration for a Personal AI Assistant.